{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026WtVZsdF8qE1794816348.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>冼靖峰（Archie）近日工作排得密麻麻，既要忙於拍劇，又積極籌備下月於麥花臣舉行的演唱會。儘管日程緊湊，為答謝粉絲一直以來的支持，Archie日前特意化身咖啡店一日店長，親自為現場粉絲送上精心泡製的咖啡，與大家共度愉快的下午。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"35c09d67-174f-41ea-ac28-c8e2ce77384d.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026T2FJo4KXuQ1794816348.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>完成一日店長活動後，Archie隨即趕回劇組開工，晚上更趁拍攝空檔與演唱會製作團隊進行視像會議，落足心機籌備個唱。談到香港演唱會的精彩內容，他預告歌單將全面升級，相比上次內地個唱演繹的二十多首歌，今次香港站將增加至三十多首。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a78f3b97-4860-402d-868d-f49eb7a9140a.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026n1YzBEXRQb1794816347.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了歌單升級外，Archie更透露已構思在演唱會其中一個環節加入短劇形式，他更會親自撰寫當中對白，希望為入場觀眾帶來耳目一新的驚喜體驗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.723859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:01:58.622884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:41.902872+00:00","content_hash":"7342d0d107adced7f6206869c4c64bfcc35109f8182db7436ebd69c6e55c093e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.723859+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}